1
00:00:00,868 --> 00:00:04,658
(Howard:)Where, as I'm sure you know,
no one can hear you scream.

2
00:00:07,332 --> 00:00:08,662
(Raj:)So, what do you gals do?

3
00:00:08,834 --> 00:00:10,044
(Bethany:)I work at the Gap.

4
00:00:10,210 --> 00:00:13,170
(Howard:)Really? How about that?
I've been to the Gap.

5
00:00:13,338 --> 00:00:17,338
(Raj:)I've been there as well.
I like your T-shirts with the little pocket.

6
00:00:17,634 --> 00:00:19,014
(Sarah:)I work there too.

7
00:00:19,178 --> 00:00:21,388
(Second girl:)Not that anyone cares.

8
00:00:23,223 --> 00:00:25,683
(Sarah:)You know, this place is boring.

9
00:00:26,185 --> 00:00:29,855
(Bethany:)Yeah. Why don't we go somewhere else
and have some fun?

10
00:00:30,147 --> 00:00:32,397
-[GIGGLING] Okay.
-Sure. We like fun.

11
00:00:32,608 --> 00:00:33,858
(Howard:)We are fun people.

12
00:00:34,026 --> 00:00:36,196
Uh, dark and fun.

13
00:00:36,361 --> 00:00:38,991
(Bethany:)Come on. I know a place you'll really dig.

14
00:00:39,156 --> 00:00:40,986
[HOWARD GASPS]

15
00:00:41,700 --> 00:00:44,080
(Howard:)-Did you bring the black condoms?
-In my fanny pack.

16
00:00:44,244 --> 00:00:45,824
(Howard:)Let's go.

17
00:00:47,873 --> 00:00:50,543
[NEEDLE BUZZING]

18
00:00:52,753 --> 00:00:54,923
(Raj:)Are you happy now?

19
00:00:56,757 --> 00:01:01,027
(Howard:)Not particularly.

